 "name_en": "Standard Cost Calculation (BEG)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Standard Cost Calculation (BEG)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiocfcac74c52704b70aee7a5c6bb075b17\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiocfcac74c52704b70aee7a5c6bb075b17__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This process enables you to update standard costs for products as part of annual operations planning. The costs are entered manually, and the costing run is created and executed.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item also supports parallel standard costing.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiocfcac74c52704b70aee7a5c6bb075b17__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Enter activity price</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create costing run</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute costing run</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiocfcac74c52704b70aee7a5c6bb075b17__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Calculate standard costs annually to reflect the changes in prices of purchased parts, labor and overhead costs, and bills of materials and operations needed to manufacture semi-finished and finished goods</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>标准成本计算 (BEG)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiocfcac74c52704b70aee7a5c6bb075b17\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiocfcac74c52704b70aee7a5c6bb075b17__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此流程使您能够更新产品的标准成本，作为年度运营计划的一部分。手动输入成本，创建并执行成本核算运行。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目还支持并行标准成本核算。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiocfcac74c52704b70aee7a5c6bb075b17__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">输入作业价格</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建成本核算运行</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行成本核算运行</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiocfcac74c52704b70aee7a5c6bb075b17__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">每年计算标准成本，以反映采购部件的价格变化、人工和间接费用成本以及制造半成品和成品所需的物料清单和工序</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
